---
// 番号は親の counter-reset: sec から連番で振られる
---
<h2 class="section-title"><slot /></h2>

<style>
  .section-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .8rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: normal;
    counter-increment: sec;
  }
  .section-title::before {
    content: counter(sec, decimal-leading-zero);
    width: 2.6rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    background-color: var(--accent);
    font-size: .8rem;
    text-align: center;
    clip-path: polygon(22% 0, 100% 0, 78% 100%, 0 100%);
  }
  .section-title::after {
    content: '';
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: rgb(from var(--text) r g b / .7);
  }
</style>
